# =========================================================================
# direnv — auto-loads the flake devShell on cd
# =========================================================================
# The devShell's venv is built from pyproject.toml/uv.lock via uv2nix, so
# flask + gunicorn are on PATH with NO `uv pip install` needed.
# Requires direnv + nix-direnv (omni-nix -> home/devshell.nix).
# After editing flake.nix OR this file:  direnv allow
use flake
